WEBVTT

00:00:00.147 --> 00:00:04.098
The dashboard also <b>warns you</b> about what needs your attention

00:00:04.168 --> 00:00:08.995
<b>Por cobrar</b> (to collect): how much you are owed, by whom and for how many days

00:00:09.101 --> 00:00:11.562
What sells the most

00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:16.838
<b>Se te acaba en</b> (runs out in): how many days each product lasts at the pace you sell it

00:00:16.912 --> 00:00:19.984
Send the list to your supplier from here

00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:24.807
And what is about to expire, so you sell it first
